## Example stack config

### `Pulumi.dev.yaml`

```yaml
config:
  aws:region: us-east-1
  project:environment: dev
  project:subnetIds:
    - subnet-aaa111
    - subnet-bbb222
  project:vpcSecurityGroupIds:
    - sg-aaa111
  project:k8sNamespace: default
  project:k8sServiceAccountName: app-sa
  project:dbPassword:
    secure: AAABALongEncryptedValueHere
```

### `Pulumi.prod.yaml`

```yaml
config:
  aws:region: us-east-1
  project:environment: prod
  project:subnetIds:
    - subnet-ccc333
    - subnet-ddd444
    - subnet-eee555
  project:vpcSecurityGroupIds:
    - sg-prod123
  project:oidcProviderArn: arn:aws:iam::123456789012:oidc-provider/oidc.eks.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/id/EXAMPLE
  project:oidcProviderUrl: https://oidc.eks.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/id/EXAMPLE
  project:k8sNamespace: app
  project:k8sServiceAccountName: web
  project:dbPassword:
    secure: AAABALongEncryptedValueHere
```

